{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:37 2026-11-28 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-28 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:37 2026-11-28 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3774d53cfe16b3578e7acecd09bd7e36/2026-11/002_17.png\"/><p>今日（28日）傍晚近6時，大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警，冒出陣陣濃煙，多名途人報警求助，屋主亦及時離開單位。消防到場出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，迅速將火救熄，事件中無人受傷，毋須疏散。據了解，起火原因疑單位內有煙頭燒着梳化引起火警。</p><img alt=\"大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警。dengjunrong@Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/478bad16e4328e4fae77b26b1e349848/2026-11/931796834_17969962461213237_2088732613757615021_n.jpg\" title=\"大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警。dengjunrong@Threads圖片\"/><p>大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警。dengjunrong@Threads圖片</p><img alt=\"大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警。dengjunrong@Threads圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f127e43950db2ce2b50e275bb10644c/2026-11/935110923_17969962449213237_6232823295444256128_n.jpg\" title=\"大埔頭水圍一村屋發生火警。dengjunrong@Threads圖片\"/>\n<p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T11:17:48.903074+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":232,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T10:37:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:24.672179+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T11:11:24.672179+00:00","content_hash":"d891a63760e63b50347fbe868e6766416813a210c7802dc6ca723c7d00b287b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}